        "email": "dfrank88@gmail.com",
        "user_type": "Human"
      },
      "created_date": "Tuesday, May 28, 2013 at 8:37:23 PM UTC",
      "text": "But if this is just you blowing off steam, then I don\u0027t really know what I\u0027m supposed to do right now because I really do care a fuck of a lot for you and you aren\u0027t the source of my unhappiness.",
      "topic_id": "yrXCyWXbB8g",
