    },
    {
      "creator": {
        "name": "Dan Frank",
        "email": "dfrank88@gmail.com",
        "user_type": "Human"
      },
      "created_date": "Tuesday, May 28, 2013 at 8:41:22 PM UTC",
      "text": "I thought/hoped that even though we\u0027re still \u0027figuring ourselves out\u0027 and whatever other cliched garbage people say about your 20\u0027s... that having you in my life is a really great thing. You make me laugh, seem to \u0027get me \u0027 in a way that most people don\u0027t, and you make me happy. But from what you said last night, you\u0027re not seeing it the same way.",
