      "message_id": "AAAALGmA2vQ/cMeVez907-Y/cMeVez907-Y"
    },
    {
      "creator": {
        "name": "Alexis A",
        "email": "lexieamb@gmail.com",
        "user_type": "Human"
      },
      "created_date": "Wednesday, May 29, 2013 at 12:02:45 AM UTC",
      "text": "From what I said last night? Do you not remember blatantly telling me that I was doing something behind your back? There was no telling you otherwise, you kept trying to use my words against me, and it was all OVER NOTHING. But the worst was today, and you basically telling me to get out, and telling Joe how much I depend on you financially. That felt so shitty, and its never been how you \u0026 I operate, even when we\u0027re fighting, and its not okay. I\u0027ve never been with you because I NEEDED to be or because it benefited me in any way",
      "topic_id": "RyVBk5IBS8U",
